Historical screenshot: docs/assets/blue-angels-example.png
Created for @jmania's October 2026 Blue Angels photography guide. The screenshot
includes Esri World Street Map content and its licensors, credited on the image:
Esri, HERE, Garmin, USGS, Intermap, INCREMENT P, NRCan, METI, NGCC,
OpenStreetMap contributors, and the GIS User Community (plus service licensors).
Esri static-map terms: https://doc.arcgis.com/en/arcgis-online/reference/static-maps.htm
The historical flight inputs were user-provided ADS-B Exchange KML exports;
those raw exports and downloaded basemap/elevation datasets are not bundled.

Original analysis sources (not required for the synthetic examples):
- USGS 3DEP: https://www.usgs.gov/3d-elevation-program
- San Francisco building data: https://data.sfgov.org/d/ynuv-fyni
- San Francisco tall-building inventory: https://data.sfgov.org/d/5kya-mfst
- Vertical transformation grids: https://cdn.proj.org/
- KML export implementation used to investigate altitude references:
  https://github.com/wiedehopf/tar1090/blob/master/html/script.js

Runtime dependencies are installed separately under their own licenses. No
proprietary font or third-party library source is vendored. Default poster
text uses Pillow's bundled default font; users may specify a licensed font.
